PUT http://172.21.121.100:8182/restconf/data/network-topology:network-topology/topology=topology-netconf/node=sma-xrv-lsr1-alpha/yang-ext:mount/Cisco-IOS-XR-ifmgr-cfg:interface-configurations/interface-configuration=act,tunnel-te300 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Basic {{odl_basic_auth}}
